{"suttaId":"tha-ap191","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7177,7195],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap191:0.3":"Ekacāriyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap191:1.1":"“Tāvatiṃsesu devesu, mahāghoso tadā ahu;","tha-ap191:1.3":"Buddho ca loke nibbāti, mayañcamha sarāgino.","tha-ap191:2.1":"“Tesaṃ saṃvegajātānaṃ, sokasallasamaṅginaṃ;","tha-ap191:2.3":"Sabalena upatthaddho, agamaṃ buddhasantikaṃ.","tha-ap191:3.1":"“Mandāravaṃ gahetvāna, saṅgīti [saṇhitaṃ (sī.), saṅgitaṃ (syā.)] abhinimmitaṃ;","tha-ap191:3.3":"Parinibbutakālamhi, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap191:4.1":"“Sabbe devānumodiṃsu, accharāyo ca me tadā;","tha-ap191:4.3":"Kappānaṃ satasahassaṃ, duggatiṃ nupapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap191:5.1":"“Saṭṭhikappasahassamhi, ito soḷasa te janā;","tha-ap191:5.3":"Mahāmallajanā nāma, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap191:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap191:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekacāriyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap191:8.1":"Ekacāriyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
